'''Squishy Cave''' (ぷにぷに鍾乳洞 ''Puni Puni Shōnyūdō'', '''Squishy Limestone Cave''') is the 9th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 3rd sub-chapter of Stories of Legends and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Could be difficult, because of all the new enemies. [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]] will appear often in this sub-chapter, but [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Flower Cat]], [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Cat Gunslinger]] and [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Tin Cat]] will not help due to their Single Target attacks. Use [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Weightlifter Cat]] if you have them. [[Camelle]] appears in the last stage, be aware of his long range and fast attacks. If you don't have units that outrange Camelle, you'll want to defeat him with fast-moving units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] or tanky units like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]. The hardest stages in this sub-chapter are [[Juvenile Killer]] (many [[Master A.|Master As]] appear) and [[Chubby B. Goode]] (Camelle's first appearance).
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces three new enemies:
*[[Gory Dark]]: A very fast [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that, while not as strong as [[Shadow Boxer K]], is still quite powerful. Has very well-rounded stats overall, with rapid, hard-hitting Area Attacks and a large number of knockbacks.
*[[Owlbrow]]: A [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy with decent range, moderate stats and Area Attacks. Can be treated as a stronger version of [[Mooth]].
*[[Camelle]]: An enemy with exceptional range, moderate damage, fairly high health and fast attacks. Can stall the player for a very long time if protected by a lot of peons, as demonstrated in [[Chubby B. Goode]].
*While not his first appearance in-game, [[Assassin Bear]], a Dark enemy, makes his first appearance in Stories of Legend here. He has incredibly fast movement speed, massive range and high DPS. Fortunately, his health is low enough that he can usually be killed with the default [[Cat Cannon]].

